  "definitions": "<defs xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><marker id=\"arrow\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L9,4 L0,8 Z\" fill=\"#263348\" /></marker></defs>\n",
  "extras": "<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"37\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">APPNP restart propagation  |  Module overview</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">APPNP iteration template / alpha=.1 / K=3 / no task head  /  read bottom to top</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"55.0\" y=\"780\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f8d4e1\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"78.0\" y=\"793\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"78.0\" dy=\"0\">Inputs</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"780\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#c8ebfb\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"263.0\" y=\"793\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"263.0\" dy=\"0\">Propagation</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"425.0\" y=\"780\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#dfdff8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"448.0\" y=\"793\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"448.0\" dy=\"0\">Parameters</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"610.0\" y=\"780\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff6bd\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"633.0\" y=\"793\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"633.0\" dy=\"0\">Add / norm</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"795.0\" y=\"780\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#cdeaf8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"818.0\" y=\"793\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"818.0\" dy=\"0\">Tensor ops</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"980.0\" y=\"780\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#c9f1cd\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"1003.0\" y=\"793\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"1003.0\" dy=\"0\">Gates</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"425.0\" y=\"810\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f3f5f7\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"448.0\" y=\"823\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"448.0\" dy=\"0\">Topology</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"610.0\" y=\"810\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#dfdff8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"633.0\" y=\"823\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"633.0\" dy=\"0\">Output</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"851\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">Read bottom to top; all module internals follow the same direction.</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Same operator color does not imply shared weights; instance/parameter identities are preserved in IR.</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Solid edges carry values; dashed edges carry topology, shape or loop state. Library kernels stay opaque.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"925\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">Reviewed static source + selected profile. Repeated groups are templates; shapes are not runtime observations.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"955\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">E### = source span; dashed = side / shape dependencies; fork/join roles are typed in IR; no implicit sum.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"980\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">Repeated colors encode operation roles. Shared weights and independent instances are recorded in semantic_ir.json.</tspan>\n</text>\n",
